# Pairs with DenialNotClientError. The app tool's invocation-time refusal is
# marked as a client error, so a revoked caller is told it made a mistake and
# the refusal is counted and logged as one.
MODULE: AppDenialAsClientError
TARGET: DenialNotClientError
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the app tool's invocation refusal is answered as a client error
PERTURBS: CallAppTool

--- FIND
ELSE IF bad THEN "clientError" ELSE IF permitted THEN "ok" ELSE "denied"
--- REPLACE
ELSE IF bad THEN "clientError" ELSE IF permitted THEN "ok" ELSE "clientError"
--- END
